---
// Contact / call-to-action section. Used at the bottom of most pages.
---

<section id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">
          <span class="txt-en">Start a conversation</span>
          <span class="txt-id">Mulai percakapan</span>
        </div>
        <h2>
          <span class="txt-en">What are you crossing to China for?</span>
          <span class="txt-id">Apa tujuan Anda menyeberang ke Tiongkok?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="lead">
          <span class="txt-en">Studies, treatment, products or growth — tell us where you want to go. We reply within one business day, in Bahasa Indonesia or English.</span>
          <span class="txt-id">Studi, pengobatan, produk, atau pertumbuhan — ceritakan tujuan Anda. Kami membalas dalam satu hari kerja, dalam Bahasa Indonesia atau Inggris.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="contact-lines">
          <a class="contact-line" href="mailto:ma@laiba.com">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7fd8b5" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m2 7 10 6 10-6"/></svg>
            ma@laiba.com
          </a>
          <a class="contact-line" href="https://wa.me/6289669367988" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#25d366" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2 22l5.25-1.38a9.9 9.9 0 0 0 4.79 1.22h.01c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.82 9.82 0 0 0 12.04 2Zm0 18.15h-.01a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-4.19-1.15l-.3-.18-3.12.82.83-3.04-.2-.31a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-1.26-4.38c0-4.54 3.7-8.24 8.25-8.24 2.2 0 4.27.86 5.83 2.42a8.18 8.18 0 0 1 2.41 5.83c0 4.54-3.7 8.23-8.24 8.23Z"/></svg>
            +62 896-6936-7988
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/6289669367988" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="txt-en">Chat on WhatsApp</span>
          <span class="txt-id">Chat via WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-w" href="mailto:ma@laiba.com">
          <span class="txt-en">Email our team →</span>
          <span class="txt-id">Kirim email →</span>
        </a>
        <p class="cta-note">
          <span class="txt-en">Average first reply: under 6 working hours</span>
          <span class="txt-id">Rata-rata balasan pertama: di bawah 6 jam kerja</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  :global(#contact) {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 88% 0%, rgba(14,124,91,.28), transparent 42%),
                linear-gradient(155deg, #0e2c4d 0%, #081d36 100%);
    padding: 92px 0;
  }
  :global(#contact .kicker) { color: #7fd8b5; }
  :global(#contact .kicker:before) { background: var(--lantern); }
  :global(#contact h2) { color: #fff; }
  .lead { color: #c6d4e6; max-width: 560px; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 15.5px; }
  .cta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 40px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .contact-lines { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 26px; }
  .contact-line { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: #eaf1f9; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;
    padding: 10px 15px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    border-radius: 12px; min-height: 44px; transition: .25s ease; text-decoration: none; }
  .contact-line:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.34); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .contact-line svg { flex: none; }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-width: 250px; }
  .cta-actions .btn { width: 100%; }
  .cta-note { font-size: 13px; color: #9db1c9; text-align: center; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .cta { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
    .cta-actions { width: 100%; min-width: 0; }
  }
</style>
